+documented idempotency. See [the event definitions](https://open.kuaishou.com/miniGameDocs/operation/DSP/DSP-IAA#%E5%9B%9B%E3%80%81%E7%A3%81%E5%8A%9B%E6%99%BA%E6%8A%95%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%9B%9E%E4%BC%A0)
